1. Store Procedure 
Definition: 
Procedure is block of SQL Statement or block of SQL Statement logics which is used for reusability purpose 
means if we want to reuse procedure just we need to call it.
Means using procedure we can reuse SQL logics more than one time.

Syntax: 
delimiter//
create procedure ProcedureName()
begin
   SQL Statements;
end//
delimiter;

Example:
delimiter //
create procedure GetAllMedicines()
begin
    select * from medicien;
end//
delimiter;

